        <h3>Prepare here. Be present there.</h3>
        <span class="method ai">AI-assisted build</span>
        <p class="result"><strong>3-step</strong> ticket booking</p>
        <p>A farm-visit planner for families: choose a date, add activities, and prepare with a personalized checklist. The research, product decisions, and content are mine; the working prototype was built with AI assistance.</p>
        <ul><li>Human-centered design</li><li>AI prototyping</li><li>Usability testing</li><li>Concept</li></ul>
