        </div>
        <div class="meta"><span>Harvard Graduate Coursework</span><span class="year">2026</span></div>
        <h3>Planning that respects more than your time.</h3>
        <span class="method ai">AI-assisted prototype</span>
        <p class="result"><strong>8</strong> connected life areas</p>
        <p>Orbit is a personal productivity concept that plans around time, energy, and priorities—not hours alone—and adapts when the day changes. It was modeled as an interactive concept with structured CMS content.</p>
        <ul><li>Product concept</li><li>Framer CMS</li><li>AI prototyping</li><li>Concept</li></ul>
        <span class="card-link static">Case study in progress</span>
      </article>

      <article class="build-card">
